Subject: [PATCH 3/6] feat(data): validate persisted/imported data with Zod
 schemas and a repair report

- New pure module src/lib/schema.ts: per-entity Zod schemas, sanitizeStoreData()
- migrate() now rejects non-backups ({}, [], null, version-only, newer version)
- Bad entries are skipped/repaired and reported instead of failing the whole backup
- Task.completedAt added (optional, backward compatible); not used by the UI yet
- Tests for migrate/migrateWithReport
